---
title: "HN collect flow (current / Implemented)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Par as patterns.parallel run_sources (coordinator)
    participant Run as SourceRunner returned by hn_runner() (worker thread)
    participant HN as agents.hn (HN business logic: prompts, domain, thresholds)
    participant Graph as patterns.react StateGraph (generic engine)
    participant LLM as llm.complete_structured (OpenRouter)
    participant Col as collectors.tavily
    participant API as Tavily API

    Par->>Run: asyncio.to_thread(runner.run, query)
    Run->>HN: _run_for_parallel(query, max_results)
    HN->>HN: reason_llm = partial(complete_structured, models=REASON_MODELS)
    HN->>HN: observe_llm = partial(complete_structured, models=OBSERVE_MODELS)
    HN->>Graph: run_react(ReActConfig(search_fn, reason_llm, observe_llm, prompts, ...), query)

    loop reason -> act -> observe (until done or max_iterations)
        Graph->>LLM: config.reason_llm(original_query + feedback) -> ReasonDecision
        LLM-->>Graph: ReasonDecision(must_keep_terms, thought, query)
        Graph->>HN: act_node: config.search_fn(query, max_results)
        HN->>Col: search_articles(query, Source.HACKER_NEWS, include_domains=HN_DOMAINS)
        Col->>API: TavilyClient.search(query, include_domains)
        API-->>Col: raw results[]
        Col->>Col: parse_tavily_results() -> SourceItemList
        Col-->>HN: SourceItemList
        HN-->>Graph: SourceItemList
        alt zero items
            Graph->>Graph: no_results_node: stop_reason = NO_RESULTS -> END
        else one or more items
            Graph->>HN: config.build_score_payload(items)
            HN-->>Graph: source-shaped payload
            Graph->>LLM: config.observe_llm({original_query, generated_query, results}) -> SourceBatchScore
            LLM-->>Graph: SourceBatchScore(relevance, novelty, quality)
            Graph->>Graph: best_score/best_items, iteration++, done? (score_threshold / max_iterations)
        end
    end

    Graph-->>HN: ReActResult(best_items, trace, stop_reason)
    HN->>HN: build SourceOutput from stop_reason + min(MIN_ARTICLES, max_results)
    HN-->>Run: SourceOutput(items, status, error)
    Run-->>Par: SourceRunResult (adds source, elapsed_ms)

    Note over HN,Graph: PULSE_VERBOSE=1 streams live Reason/Act/Observe progress to<br/>stderr from within the worker thread; PULSE_LOG_LEVEL controls debug logging.<br/>The full ReActResult.trace itself is not returned past this flow.
